{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19233","headline":"和仆射牛相公见示长句 · 刘禹锡","name":"和仆射牛相公见示长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"静得天和兴自浓，不缘宦达性灵慵。\n大鹏六月有闲意，仙鹤千年无躁容。\n流辈尽来多叹息，官班高後少过从。\n唯应加筑露台上，賸见终南云外峰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19233.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19233","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}